102.JPG 1 Vince wears a hard hat. These pipes are angled to avoid coal dust settling and acumulating
105.JPG 1 Eurographics 2002 reception dinner at the Völklingen Ironworks.
106.JPG 1 Creative lighting on the flywheel
107.JPG 1 Creative lighting with creative photography with machinery
108.JPG 1 And now, Marco! In his home in Pisa!
109.JPG 1 Pisa is a beautifull Tuscan city, with much to see! And I have a first rate tour from a local.
110.JPG 1 We even visit the leaning tower of Pisa
111.JPG 1 Watch out Marco! It may fall someday!
112.JPG 2 Baptismal building or something something in Pisa. 
113.JPG 1 Time for food. Letista has brought good things from Sicily. Some goat cheese, some bovine.
115.JPG 2 We ride bikes, are you handling the camera safely Marco?
117.JPG 1 I lean out of a residental window in Pisa. Behind me is a butterfly, so beautifull
118.JPG 3 Pisa, crossing back to the inner city
