137.JPG 1 The river with no fish, and a bridge across it all built up.
140.JPG 3 I remembered visiting the boboli gardens in Florence when I was young, so I returned.
142.JPG 1 A statue of a naked man playing golf, plus other mostly naked humans, in the boboli gardens.
144.JPG 1 More of the crowds of Florence. My day trip was not what I hoped, I was blocked by the people. I did not see David.
146.JPG 1 Marco and I went to hear some electronic music. The DJ is red.
149.JPG 1 I am returning home via Frankfurt. I tour museums all day.
150.JPG 1 and head to the old town for my last german meal. Spatzels and beer of course!
151.JPG 1 Frankfurt at night.
153.JPG 2 Airplane home. Dream of flying. Dream of dying. For what is life but sweet death delayed. I have enjoyed it.
